        <item>
            <title>3.1.3</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 01:06:28 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>154</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.1.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- Claude Code extension updates install again on Macs whose Node.js comes from a version manager (mise, asdf, nvm, Volta). The start check that guards each update ran the version manager's shim in a scratch home folder, where it could not find Node, so every update was refused with "the extension host exited with status 1".
]]></description>
